# runtime state files (never commit) -- ADDED 2026-08-18: moved under state/,
# a named Docker volume in production (see docker-compose.yml), but a bare
# directory locally too -- ignore the whole thing rather than the individual
# filenames it used to be. Root-level entries kept too, defensively, in case
# a stray local run ever writes to the old pre-migration path again.
state/
noc_state.json
alert_state.json
alert_settings.json

# Vendored uv/uvx binaries for the Docker build (ghcr.io unreachable from
# WSL2 -- same workaround as study-platform). Build-context-only: rsynced to
# WSL by the deploy script, never committed (38 MB).
uv
uvx
